---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Inicio - Turismo Lebu">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[90vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Background Image with Overlay -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1471922694854-ff1b63b20054?q=80&w=2000" 
        alt="Costa de Lebu" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-lebu-dark/90 via-lebu-dark/50 to-transparent"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center mt-20">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-md">
        Descubre la magia de <br/>
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-lebu-magenta via-lebu-orange to-lebu-yellow">
          Lebu
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-10 text-gray-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light drop-shadow">
        Playas de arenas oscuras, imponentes cavernas, rica historia minera y vientos que traen historias del sur de Chile.
      </p>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 flex-col sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="/mapa"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-r from-lebu-teal to-lebu-green text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-xl"
        >
          Explorar el Mapa
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#descubre"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/50 text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-white/30 transition-colors duration-300 shadow-xl"
        >
          Conocer más
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section id="descubre" class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-lebu-dark mb-4 drop-shadow-sm">
          ¿Por qué visitar Lebu?
        </h2>
        <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-lebu-orange to-lebu-yellow mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-gray-600 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Sumérgete en un destino lleno de contrastes, donde la naturaleza salvaje se encuentra con un patrimonio cultural incalculable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="group rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?q=80&w=1000" 
              alt="Playas Únicas" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" 
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-6">
               <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-lebu-teal text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-2">Costa</span>
               <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Playas Únicas</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Disfruta de arenas negras y paisajes costeros impresionantes como la Playa Millaneco, ideales para la contemplación y los deportes acuáticos.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="group rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549887534-1541e9326642?q=80&w=1000" 
              alt="Cavernas y Naturaleza" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" 
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-6">
               <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-lebu-green text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-2">Exploración</span>
               <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Naturaleza</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Adéntrate en las majestuosas Cavernas de Benavides, imponentes formaciones rocosas esculpidas por el océano y el viento a través de los milenios.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="group rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="relative h-64 overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582298538104-db278184c7a6?q=80&w=1000" 
              alt="Cultura e Historia" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500" 
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-6">
               <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-lebu-magenta text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full mb-2">Patrimonio</span>
               <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Cultura</h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Conoce la rica historia minera y las tradiciones locales de la capital de la provincia de Arauco, recorriendo sus calles y miradores.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-lebu-dark to-gray-900 border-t-4 border-lebu-orange">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Comienza tu aventura</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-10 font-light">
        Arma tu itinerario agregando lugares a tus favoritos y prepárate para un viaje inolvidable.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/favoritos"
        class="inline-block bg-white text-lebu-dark font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-gradient-to-r hover:from-lebu-yellow hover:to-lebu-orange hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(253,185,19,0.4)]"
      >
        Mi Itinerario
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
